answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-48713" :question/id #uuid "e8e244de-d84d-53fe-b83d-97c217781212" :question/math-academy-id "q-48713" :question/problem "${lim}_{x\\to \\infty }\\frac{|7x-4|}{2x-6}=$" :question/worked-solution "For large positive values of $x,$ we have $|7x-4|=7x-4.$ Consequently, for $x\\to \\infty ,$ we get\n\n$$\n{lim}_{x\\to \\infty }\\frac{|7x-4|}{2x-6}={lim}_{x\\to \\infty }\\frac{7x-4}{2x-6}.\n$$\n\nFirst, we divide both the numerator and the denominator by the highest power of $x$ in the denominator, which is ${x}^{1}.$ Then, by noting that the reciprocals shrink to $0$ in the limit, we can then evaluate the resulting expression.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to \\infty }\\frac{7x-4}{2x-6} & ={lim}_{x\\to \\infty }\\frac{(\\frac{7x}{x}-\\frac{4}{x})}{(\\frac{2x}{x}-\\frac{6}{x})} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to \\infty }\\frac{(7-\\frac{4}{x})}{(2-\\frac{6}{x})} \\\\  & =\\frac{7-0}{2-0} \\\\  & =\\frac{7}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-48713/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "32cbf366-20bd-5a52-a14f-83add698bf07"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-48713"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-339421/field-1/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer/id #uuid "d6f8e3ec-a75e-53fe-b29a-1366c55b7a1b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-339421/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "286f59c2-1895-5098-9962-872de30b9e95" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-339421/field-1/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer-field/choices ["q-339421/field-1/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-339421" :question/id #uuid "a921d240-c753-5086-9f3e-3453deca86b6" :question/math-academy-id "q-339421" :question/problem "Evaluate the limit:\n\n${lim}_{x\\to \\infty }\\frac{2}{4{x}^{6}-5x}=$\n\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "First, we divide both the numerator and the denominator by the highest power of $x$ in the denominator, which is ${x}^{6}.$ Then, by noting that the reciprocals shrink to $0$ in the limit, we can then evaluate the resulting expression.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to \\infty }\\frac{2}{4{x}^{6}-5x} & ={lim}_{x\\to \\infty }\\frac{(\\frac{2}{{x}^{6}})}{(\\frac{4{x}^{6}}{{x}^{6}}-\\frac{5x}{{x}^{6}})} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to \\infty }\\frac{(\\frac{2}{{x}^{6}})}{(4-\\frac{5}{{x}^{5}})} \\\\  & =\\frac{0}{4-0} \\\\  & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-339421/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "32cbf366-20bd-5a52-a14f-83add698bf07"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-339421"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-339612/field-1/e7bc415b91e8e2558c763c56ce6657ae30e51a7e3c0c90c1d4cd29cdacdf8934" :answer/id #uuid "74885b07-6eb9-512f-88de-44f3f84c5a50" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\infty" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-339612/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "59067eab-dbc9-5efb-a806-44544690b377" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-339612/field-1/e7bc415b91e8e2558c763c56ce6657ae30e51a7e3c0c90c1d4cd29cdacdf8934" :answer-field/choices ["q-339612/field-1/e7bc415b91e8e2558c763c56ce6657ae30e51a7e3c0c90c1d4cd29cdacdf8934"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-339612" :question/id #uuid "4c34786e-7329-5ee5-938e-61e317be395c" :question/math-academy-id "q-339612" :question/problem "Evaluate the limit:\n\n${lim}_{x\\to -\\infty }\\,\\,\\frac{-{x}^{6}+4x}{{x}^{2}+x+5}=$\n\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "First, we divide both the numerator and the denominator by the highest power of $x$ in the denominator, which is ${x}^{2}.$ Then, by noting that the reciprocals shrink to $0$ in the limit, we can then evaluate the resulting expression.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to -\\infty }\\,\\,\\frac{-{x}^{6}+4x}{{x}^{2}+5} & ={lim}_{x\\to -\\infty }\\,\\,\\frac{(\\frac{-{x}^{6}}{{x}^{2}}+\\frac{4x}{{x}^{2}})}{(\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{x}^{2}}+\\frac{5}{{x}^{2}})} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to -\\infty }\\,\\,\\frac{(-{x}^{4}+\\frac{4}{x})}{(1+\\frac{5}{{x}^{2}})} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to -\\infty }\\,\\,\\frac{(-{x}^{4}+0)}{(1+0)} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to -\\infty }\\,\\,-{x}^{4} \\\\  & =-\\infty .\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-339612/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "020c3de3-bcaf-5ade-ba50-2f15e344157d"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-339612"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-68042/selection/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer/id #uuid "fb19bf2c-b246-58ae-9a01-dbc27873fffe" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-68042/selection/b13ac151352392d38026eed875b911708c50c896d6c09463410ac041030163ff" :answer/id #uuid "a35826e3-9244-560e-bae1-16d0d8301bae" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-68042/selection/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer/id #uuid "c40cae5c-e380-5fc9-89d2-2763c1f99aac" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-68042/selection/64ee21896e4acdba2b7ccd5d21e7c3b0caad319fb011e671d6ce72f671b3bb6c" :answer/id #uuid "639aecb5-788d-592b-9191-6c127d73fd3b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\infty " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-68042/selection/ce613869d158ee65610d5a29cd642712ce8ff839e4d13681a91669926bfe6116" :answer/id #uuid "9d78b262-8211-5a33-bcbc-d2c3c6a652e3" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "Does not exist." :db/ensure [:answe